Bolt Balance terms and conditions are available here: [https://assets.ctfassets.net/tk7rwcciwvbq/7qaZbeipV4GI87JBKvBLjD/3c693c31cad8853d3c72ffa3a8feca20/Bolt_Balance_Noteikumi_Un_Nosaci__jumi__Spe__ka___sta__s__ana__s_datums_21.07.2022_.pdf|https://assets.ctfassets.net/tk7rwcciwvbq/7qaZbeipV4GI87JBKvBLjD/3c693c31cad8853d3c72ffa3a8feca20/Bolt_Balance_Noteikumi_Un_Nosaci__jumi__Spe__ka___sta__s__ana__s_datums_21.07.2022_.pdf]

The details are also given in the applicable terms and conditions. 

We are not providing any financial services, even the payment processing done via external service provider. Bolt Balance is only connected to services provided on Bolt platform and can be used only on Bolt platform. If you look at the applicable terms and conditions, the scope is very limited and works only in one way (meaning - the customer cannot withdraw anything from Bolt Balance, it is connected to only one currency etc).

Section 1.1.1. a-c give the limited scope Bolt Balance can be used. Simply put - failed payment, penalties or refunds.

Legal basis for negative Bolt Balance statement is also stated in the applicable terms and conditions, please see sections 5.1. and 5.2. 

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
*DEBETI NO BOLT BALANCE* 

_5.1. Ja jūsu Bolt Balance ir pieejamas summas, mēs varam debetēt no jūsu Bolt Balance jebkādas summas, ko esat mums parādā saistībā ar Bolt lietotnes izmantošanu vai Bolt lietotnē pieejamo preču un pakalpojumu iegādi vai izmantošanu, tai skaitā gadījumos, kas norādīti 1.1.1. punktā, pat tad, ja neesat atlasījis Bolt Balance kā noklusējuma apmaksas veidu._ 

_5.2. Ja jūsu Bolt Balance nav pieejamas pietiekamas summas, lai segtu visu summu, ko esat parādā saistībā ar Bolt lietotnes izmantošanu vai Bolt lietotnē pieejamo preču un pakalpojumu iegādi vai izmantošanu, šīs summas var debetēt no jūsu Bolt Balance (pieejamo summu) un jebkura no jūsu maksājumu instrumentiem, kas Bolt lietotnē pievienoti kā apmaksas veidi (atlikušo summu)._
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
If we want to draw a parallel: consumers can also buy (things/services) and pay in instalments. Paying in instalments is commercial conditions and not considered a financial service. But if the same sum is given by an external party for completing the purchase, then it is. 

For example: [https://www.tele2.lv/telefoni/apple-iphone-13-512gb/|https://www.tele2.lv/telefoni/apple-iphone-13-512gb/|smart-link] vs [https://www.credit24.lv/|https://www.credit24.lv/|smart-link]  
{panel}

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
_Without going into too much details regarding 1.1.1. c, our payment processor doesn’t allow partial refunds, Bolt Balance is used for this. For example - if you have 100 EUR order from Bolt Food, but it’s missing 2 EUR item, we can choose to return the whole sum (100 EUR) or 2 EUR to Bolt Balance. Otherwise the user has to contact the service provider and claim it from them._
{panel}

